[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4443268395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118973#issuecomment-4443268395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118973","id":4443268395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNblKw","user":{"login":"realkotob","id":43449832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNDQ5ODMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43449832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob","html_url":"https://github.com/realkotob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realkotob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-13T16:40:41Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T16:57:19Z","body":"I ran some benchmarks and created a Minimum Reproduction Project to make it easier to discuss this during the meeting.\r\n\r\n**Benchmark:**\r\n\r\nHardware: Apple M1 Pro, macOS 26.4, Metal 4.0 / Forward+. \r\nGodot: `4.7-beta.custom_build` — stock master `aaaf76403e8` vs PR-branch\r\n`3fe3dc2e29d` \r\n\r\n| Particles | Path A (readback, µs) | Path B (PR direct, µs) | Speedup |\r\n|-----------|------------------------|--------------------------|---------|\r\n| 1,024     | **3,643.8**            | **6.7**                  | **547×** |\r\n| 4,096     | **12,961.5**           | **6.5**                  | **1,999×** |\r\n| 16,384    | **49,831.2**           | **6.5**                  | **7,647×** |\r\n| 65,536    | **197,914.3**          | **6.5**                  | **30,448×** |\r\n\r\n\r\n**Minimum Reproduction Project**: [pr118973-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27720105/pr118973-mrp.zip) (instructions in the README)\r\n\r\n**Screenshots:**\r\n<details>\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"780\" height=\"454\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-13 at 19 46 09\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d5d43be-4497-4b90-afe3-42981f48401d\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"786\" height=\"472\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-13 at 19 48 36\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1e45ace3-dd07-4bab-bba6-f884cc1377eb\" />\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4443268395/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4503925278","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118973#issuecomment-4503925278","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118973","id":4503925278,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDHRyHg","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-21T01:14:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T01:14:34Z","body":"Had a look at this during the rendering meeting. Code wise this looks fine.\r\n\r\nThis feature should be marked as experimental. The biggest issue I foresee is that any usage of this feature will always risk breakage because we would always want to be able to change the layout of these buffers and not set their layout in stone. That should be adequately documented somewhere.\r\n\r\nNote: I'd also like to see a more substantial example project that shows the use case for this feature.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4503925278/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4753515840","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118973#issuecomment-4753515840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118973","id":4753515840,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG1TlQA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith